## Caveats

- Peak mass bin result based on only 3 disturbed clusters — small
  sample, large amplitude, all checks pass but replication required
- Mass and redshift correlated in key bin (r=0.33, p=0.001) from
  Malmquist bias — does not confound within-bin result but noted
- Wavelet null test used ΛCDM synthetic maps not full FFP10
  end-to-end Planck simulations
- D_A²-corrected classifier changes morphology split significantly —
  the optimal classifier for this analysis remains under investigation
- Independent replication on PSZ2 by Frode Hansen (University of
  Oslo) using full Planck simulation suite pending

